# 📊 SHEET LAYOUT (IMPORTANT)
Create a Google Sheet with this layout:

```
A1: City
B1: Temperature (°C)
C1: Wind Speed (km/h)
D1: Weather Code
E1: Condition
F1: Last Updated
```

